sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Cliente/Aplicación
    participant Router as OSB Router<br/>(ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumo.pipeline)
    participant GTPS as OSB Pipeline GT<br/>(ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumoGT.pipeline)
    participant TokenSvc as TokenizacionProcesamientoBlaze
    participant OICGT as OIC originacionesGT<br/>(processWithDecisionFlow2)
    participant ErrorMapper as MapeoErrores

    Note over Client, OICGT: Flujo Guatemala (GT01) - ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumo

    Client->>Router: SOAP Request (consultaOfertaCreditoConsumo)
    Note right of Client: Header: SourceBank=GT01<br/>Body: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoRequest

    Router->>Router: Validar XSD contra consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoTypes.xsd
    Note right of Router: Validate element:<br/>con:consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoRequest

    alt Validación XSD Fallida
        Router->>ErrorMapper: wsCallout mapeoErrores
        ErrorMapper-->>Router: Error formateado
        Router-->>Client: SOAP Response (ERROR)
    end

    Router->>Router: wsCallout consultaRutaRegional_db
    Note right of Router: ServiceId: FICBCO0399<br/>Version: V2<br/>Operation: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumo

    alt Ruta Regional No Válida (PV_CODIGO_ERROR != SUCCESS)
        Router-->>Client: SOAP Response (ERROR: PV_MENSAJE_ERROR)
    end

    Router->>Router: Obtener $ubicacion = PV_UBICACION
    Note right of Router: $ubicacion = Middleware/v2/ProxyServices/<br/>ConsultaOfertaCreditoConsumoGT

    Router->>GTPS: Dynamic Route → pipeline GT
    Note right of Router: Enrutamiento dinámico por $ubicacion

    GTPS->>TokenSvc: wsCallout tokenizacionProcesamientoBlaze
    Note right of GTPS: Request: body + header original<br/>Obtener token para OIC
    TokenSvc-->>GTPS: Response con header + body
    Note left of TokenSvc: $errorCode = successIndicator<br/>$validationMessage = messages (si no SUCCESS)<br/>$token = RSPtokenizacionProcesamientoBlaze/TOKEN

    GTPS->>GTPS: Stage "OriginacionesGT"

    alt $validationMessage = "" (Token OK)
        GTPS->>GTPS: $token = $RSPtokenizacionProcesamientoBlaze/TOKEN

        GTPS->>GTPS: Transformar Request
        Note right of GTPS: XQ: processWithDecisionFlow2In.xqy<br/>Params: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoRequest + $token<br/>Mapeo: datos cliente, referencias, scores,<br/>tarjetas, consultaTuca (con conversión fechas)<br/>Campos constantes: antiguedades=0, estados=0

        GTPS->>OICGT: wsCallout processWithDecisionFlow2 (POST/SOAP)
        Note right of GTPS: Endpoint: https://oic.ocservices.ficohsa.com<br/>/ic/ws/integration/v1/flows/soap/<br/>EPORIGINACIONESG_SOAP/1.0/<br/>Auth: HTTP Basic (Service Account DEVCLOUD)<br/>Timeout: 70s | ConnTimeout: 65s

        OICGT-->>GTPS: $RSPprocessWithDecisionFlow2
        Note left of OICGT: Contiene: return/accion (métricas),<br/>return/oferta (ofertas), return/audit (steps)

    else $validationMessage != "" (Token Fallido)
        Note right of GTPS: No se invoca motor de decisión<br/>Se continúa al response pipeline
    end

    GTPS->>GTPS: Stage "ProcesamientoSalida" (Response Pipeline)

    alt No hay auditSteps[type='ERROR'] en respuesta
        GTPS->>GTPS: Transformar Response
        Note right of GTPS: XQ: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoGTOut.xqy<br/>Param: processWithDecisionFlow2Response<br/>→ consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoResponse<br/>Mapeo: noSolicitud→CASE_ID, rciFinal→GENERAL_RCI,<br/>rciMax→GENERAL_RCI_MAX, ofertas, tarjetas...<br/>Header: successIndicator=Success
    else Hay auditSteps[type='ERROR']
        GTPS->>GTPS: Construir respuesta de error
        Note right of GTPS: Header: successIndicator=ERROR<br/>Messages: stepMessage de cada auditStep ERROR<br/>Body: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoResponse vacío
    end

    GTPS-->>Router: Response pipeline GT completado
    Router->>Router: Stage "MapeoError" (Response)
    Note right of Router: Si successIndicator != SUCCESS:<br/>wsCallout MapeoErrores<br/>FICBCO0399 + messages

    Router-->>Client: SOAP Response
    Note left of Router: Header: ResponseHeader<br/>Body: consultaOfertaCreditoConsumoResponse
